= 0.000017616$.\n\nSum: $1 - 1.4458 + 0.52258441 - 0.083950 + 0.0075825 - 0.00043869 + 0.000017616$\n$= 1 - 1.4458 = -0.4458$\n$-0.4458 + 0.52258441 = 0.07678441$\n$0.07678441 - 0.083950 = -0.00716559$\n$-0.00716559 + 0.0075825 = 0.00041691$\n$0.00041691 - 0.00043869 = -0.00002178$\n$-0.00002178 + 0.000017616 = -0.00000416$\n\nSo at $x = 1.4458$, $f(x) \\approx -0.00000416$, very close to zero. Good, this confirms $x \\approx 1.4458$.\n\nThe answer is $\\boxed{1.4458}$.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1787056097}
